.TH LXQT-QDBUS "1" "August 2026" "LXQt 0.4.1" "LXQt Wayland session"
.SH NAME
lxqt-qdbus \- D-Bus wrapper for keybinds on Wayland compositors
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B lxqt-qdbus
.RI [ options ]
.RI [ argument ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
\fBlxqt-qdbus\fR is a helper script used to set up keyboard shortcuts on
Wayland compositors that lack native LXQt integration. It wraps
\fBqdbus\fR calls to the LXQt session and its modules, so compositor
keybind configuration files can invoke common LXQt actions.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fBrun\fR \fIapplication\fR
Start an application inside \fBlxqt-session\fR.
.TP
\fBopenmenu\fR
Open the Fancy Menu.
.TP
\fBlxqt-clip\fR
Show \fBlxqt-clip\fR.
.TP
\fBshowdesktop\fR
Show the desktop on stacking window managers.
.TP
\fBrestart\fR \fImodule\fR
Restart an LXQt module. Main modules: \fBdesktop\fR, \fBpanel\fR,
\fBrunner\fR, \fBnotifications\fR, \fBpowermanagement\fR,
\fBpolicykit-agent\fR.
.TP
\fBtask\fR \fI1-10\fR
Focus the window at the given position on the taskbar.
.TP
\fBvolume\fR \fIup\fR|\fIdown\fR|\fImute\fR
Change the volume via the panel's volume plugin, falling back to
\fBwpctl\fR if no such plugin is found.
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Show a help message and exit.
.TP
\fB\-v\fR, \fB\-\-version\fR
Show version information and exit.
.SH BUGS
Bugs can be reported on https://github.com/lxqt/lxqt-wayland-session/issues.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR lxqt-wayland-session (1)
.BR startlxqtwayland (1)
